  "title": "Indonesian Spiced Rice",
  "description": "This colorful, spicy rice side dish is flavored with garlic, turmeric, cinnamon, and jalapeños. Pairs perfectly with lamb kabobs.",
  "authors": [
    "Andi"
  ],
